EasyHR database migrations (Alembic). Run every command from the api/ folder.
The database URL comes from DATABASE_URL / api/.env, never from alembic.ini.

  alembic upgrade head                                   apply all migrations
  alembic revision --autogenerate -m "add x to y"        after changing app/models.py
  alembic downgrade -1                                   undo the latest migration
  alembic check                                          fail if models and migrations differ
  alembic upgrade head --sql                             print the SQL instead of running it

Always read an autogenerated file before committing it. Autogenerate does not
detect table or column renames (it sees a drop + add, which loses data), and it
cannot write data migrations for you.
